{"identity_key": "x:2110676472503652599", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2110676472503652599", "title": null, "content": "\"Rouge\" is an agile and powerful female assassin 🗡️\n\n\n\nHowever, after being maliciously drugged, she was transformed into a male ♂️\n\n\n\n💖 Pure-hearted Rouge always selflessly helps girls in need.\n\n\n\nThis time, he encounters \"Sylphina,\" a mysterious girl with no emotional expression.\n\n\n\nWhat hardships and new romance will Rouge face in this new adventure?\n\n\n\n \"False Myth 2~Egoism of Love and Hate~\" Event: Enter to win game keys + DLsite points.👇\n\n🎁False Myth 2 Event：https://nitter.cf/t.co/MyAcOY0tq6\n\n🎀akaeroCore：https://nitter.cf/t.co/bY6lPbSzM7\n\n💛Join Discord：https://nitter.cf/t.co/Cezj2TG7Sn\n\n\n\n#akaeroCore #steam #rpg #FalseMyth2愛憎的自我沉溺 #FalseMyth2愛憎のエゴイズム #FalseMyth2EgoismofLoveandHate #FalseMyth2애증의자아탐닉", "publisher": "akaerocore", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/akaerocore/status/2110676472503652599", "published_at": "2026-10-15T10:17:40+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:17:40 GMT", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T04:49:44.474889+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "akaerocore", "author_name": "akaerocore", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": null, "views": null}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "rss"}}
{"identity_key": "x:2110677990317469768", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2110677990317469768", "title": null, "content": "「羅赫」是一位身手矯健又擁有強大實力的女刺客🗡️\n\n但是這樣的他卻被惡意下藥，而轉變成了男性♂️\n\n💖內心善良的羅赫總會無私幫助遇到困難的女孩們\n\n這次他遇到了一位沒有情緒表情的神祕少女「希爾菲娜」\n\n羅赫在新冒險中又將會遇到什麼困境與新的戀情呢？\n\n\n\n👉《False Myth 2~愛憎的自我沉溺~》活動抽遊戲序號+DLsite點數\n\n🎁False Myth 2抽獎活動：\n\nhttps://nitter.cf/t.co/xCdAuFCPO1\n\n🎀akaeroCore：https://nitter.cf/t.co/bY6lPbSzM7\n\n💛Join Discord：https://nitter.cf/t.co/Cezj2TG7Sn\n\n\n\n#akaeroCore #steam #rpg #FalseMyth2愛憎的自我沉溺 #FalseMyth2愛憎のエゴイズム #FalseMyth2EgoismofLoveandHate #FalseMyth2애증의자아탐닉", "publisher": "akaerocore", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/akaerocore/status/2110677990317469768", "published_at": "2026-10-15T10:23:42+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:23:42 GMT", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T04:49:44.474889+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "akaerocore", "author_name": "akaerocore", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": null, "views": null}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "rss"}}
{"identity_key": "x:2110678279569228141", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2110678279569228141", "title": null, "content": "‘루쥬’는 뛰어난 실력과 민첩한 몸놀림을 자랑하는 강력한 여성 암살자입니다🗡️\n\n하지만 그런 그녀가 악의적인 약물로 인해 남성으로 변하고 마는데…♂️\n\n\n\n💖선한 마음을 지닌 루쥬는 언제나 어려움에 처한 소녀들을 대가 없이 도와주곤 합니다.\n\n이번에 그는 감정도 표정도 없는 수수께끼의 소녀 ‘실피나’를 만나게 됩니다.\n\n\n\n과연 루쥬는 새로운 모험 속에서 또 어떤 위기와 새로운 사랑을 마주하게 될까요?\n\n\n\n👉《False Myth 2 애증의 자아 탐닉》 이벤트에서 게임 시리얼 코드 + DLsite 포인트를 추첨으로 드립니다!\n\n🎁 False Myth 2 경품 이벤트 참여하기:https://nitter.cf/t.co/1DIMWSnVWW\n\n🎀akaeroCore：https://nitter.cf/t.co/ZEcKX9Vbe8\n\n💛Join Discord：https://nitter.cf/t.co/GvTc4eQn7i\n\n\n\n#akaeroCore #steam #rpg #FalseMyth2愛憎的自我沉溺 #FalseMyth2愛憎のエゴイズム #FalseMyth2EgoismofLoveandHate #FalseMyth2애증의자아탐닉", "publisher": "akaeroCore_kr", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/akaeroCore_kr/status/2110678279569228141", "published_at": "2026-10-15T10:24:51+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:24:51 GMT", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T04:49:46.012977+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "akaeroCore_kr", "author_name": "akaeroCore_kr", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": null, "views": null}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "rss"}}
